0008: a collect_block whose path search gave up ("no path found"; nothing gained, nothing broken) within 30 s of a
landing (the server moved the bot more than 16 blocks: spreadplayers, a teleport, a respawn) is tried once more,
after the 5x5 chunks around the bot have loaded (mineflayer's wait, at most 10 s) and a 2 s pause. Staging, 8 games
at once: `collect oak_log 6` found no path 2.3 s after landing in one of 8 regions generating at once and gave up;
the same spot alone passed. The runtime owns the landing watch (src/world/landing.ts: mineflayer's `move`, then
`forcedMove`) and disposes of it with the bot's other listeners. With tests.

